This project analyses the UNDRR "Disaster Resilience Scorecard for Cities".
The scorecard itself is the work of UNDRR and its partners; this tool is an
independent piece of software built to work with it, and is not affiliated
with or endorsed by UNDRR.

The country and state/province lists (lib/geo/regions.json) are generated by
scripts/build-regions.mjs from iso3166-2-db (Copyright (c) 2016 esosedi,
MIT License) and iso-3166-2 (Copyright (c) 2014 Ola Holmström, MIT License).

The city names on the area map (public/cities.json and public/cities/detail/)
are generated by scripts/build-cities.mjs from all-the-cities (Copyright (c) 2018 Nabil Ashraf,
MIT License), which is built from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org),
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0.
